Commentary of al-Nasafi (Madarik al-Tanzil) on surah 38, verse 47:

(p-160) ﴿And indeed they are with Us, among the chosen ones﴾, the ones selected from among their own kind;

﴿al-akhyar﴾, the plural of "khayyir", or "khayr" with the letter lightened, like "amwat" as the plural of "mayt" or "mayyit".

Commentary of al-Nasafi (Madarik al-Tanzil) on surah 38, verse 85:

﴿Surely I shall fill Hell with you﴾, i.e., from your kind, and they are the devils;

﴿and with whoever follows you of them﴾, i.e., from the offspring of Adam;

﴿all together﴾. That is: I shall fill Hell with the ones who are followed and the ones who follow, all together, leaving not one of them behind.
